{
    "chapter_num": 45,
    "verses_count": 5,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Assurance to Baruch"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The word that Jeremiah the prophet spoke to Baruch the son of Neriah, when he had written these words in a book "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. from Jeremiah’s mouth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "at the instruction of Jeremiah, in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah, king of Judah, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Thus says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", the God of Israel, to you, O Baruch: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘You said, “Woe is me now! For the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has added grief to my sorrow. I fainted in my sighing, and I find no rest.” ’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Thus you shall say to him, ‘Thus says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": “Behold, what I have built I will break down, and what I have planted I will pluck up, that is, this whole land. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And do you seek great things for yourself? Do not seek "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for behold, I will bring adversity on all flesh,” says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". “But I will give your life to you as a prize in all places, wherever you go.” ’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}